  "limitations": [
    "VOICED contains sustained vowel phonation, not physiotherapy session speech; it is a proxy for the vocal-alteration claim.",
    "A sustained vowel has no pauses or speech onsets, so the pause-based flags (possivel_fadiga, possivel_desconforto_respiratorio) cannot fire and are not exercised here.",
    "No public dataset labels fatigue or dyspnoea during rehabilitation, so the rehabilitation-specific use case remains unvalidated.",
    "The learned baseline uses subject-grouped cross-validation; each subject contributes a single recording.",
    "The deep-embedding probe is a self-supervised model pretrained on spontaneous/read speech and applied to a sustained vowel; it is a comparison of representations, not a clinically validated classifier."
  ]
